{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":484746,"name":"Aviv Yeshayav","username":"TheAviv","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/theaviv/{size}/119258_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T23:43:35.235Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484746-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484746-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484746-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484746-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProduct: Grok Bot / Gmail MCP\u003cbr\u003e\nAccount: aviv@theaviv.ca\u003cbr\u003e\nNamespace: user-Gmail–professional-aviv-theaviv-ca\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot’s Gmail connector cannot search Spam even though the label metadata reports Spam threads.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484746-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484746-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCall list_labels — SPAM showed threadsTotal=3, threadsUnread=3.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCall search_threads with query in:spam.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlso try label:SPAM, is:spam, and broader queries with includeTrash.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompare with an Inbox search.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484746-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484746-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003esearch_threads returns the Spam threads so an agent can review Spam without using the browser.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484746-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484746-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOther\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484746-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484746-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eN/A — Gmail MCP connector issue; no Grok Bot version information available.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484746-additional-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484746-additional-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eActual: search_threads returns empty {} every time. Inbox search works, while list_labels still shows the Spam count.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImpact: cannot review or empty Spam via the connector for a query form the tool docs claim (in:spam / label:SPAM). Forced browser fallback.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso filed via in-app Send Feedback and by email to \u003ca href=\"mailto:hi@cursor.com\"\u003ehi@cursor.com\u003c/a\u003e from aviv@theaviv.ca (thread subject: Grok Bot Gmail: search_threads returns empty for Spam while list_labels shows 3 threads).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484746-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484746-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-06T23:43:43.400Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":1,"readers_count":0,"score":0.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170832,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-gmail-search-threads-returns-empty-for-spam-while-list-labels-shows-threads","display_username":"Aviv Yeshayav","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"